---
import { EARLY_ACCESS_URL, TEAM_URL } from '../config';
---
<section class="final" id="early">
  <video class="bgv" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/media/herd.jpg?v=2" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/media/herd.mp4?v=2" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="shade"></div>
  <div class="grain"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Let the cheap horse run. Check before it crosses the line.</h2>
    <p class="final-sub">We’ll email you the day <code>/plugin install horsy</code> works. No newsletter.</p>
    <div class="ctas"><a class="pill light" href={EARLY_ACCESS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get early access</a></div>
    <p class="reducers">Free for individuals · Runs locally · Verify mode first · Off with one command</p>
    <p class="teamline">Running agents across a team, or in CI? <a href={TEAM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Become a design partner</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="height:160px"></div>
</section>
